//RS     // copy counts compare the loop lowering alone. The source is a `:=`
//RS     // binding, which `fold_pure_calls` leaves alone, so its length is not a
//RS     // folded constant. A field source (`bag.names`, which sema wraps in a
//RS     // share copy) walks the same way as a local.
